    <statement><p>Find two vectors <m>\lt B&gt;\lt I&gt;v\lt /B&gt;\lt /I&gt;_1</m> and <m>\lt B&gt;\lt I&gt;v\lt /B&gt;\lt /I&gt;_2</m> whose sum is <m>\left\lt -1,-1,5\right&gt;</m>, where
<m>\lt B&gt;\lt I&gt;v\lt /B&gt;\lt /I&gt;_1</m> is parallel to <m>\left\lt -4,2,1\right&gt;</m> while <m>\lt B&gt;\lt I&gt;v\lt /B&gt;\lt /I&gt;_2</m> is perpendicular to
<m>\left\lt -4,2,1\right&gt;</m>.</p>
<p><BLOCKQUOTE>
<m>\lt B&gt;\lt I&gt;v\lt /B&gt;\lt /I&gt;_1</m> = <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/> and</BLOCKQUOTE></p>
<p><m>\lt B&gt;\lt I&gt;v\lt /B&gt;\lt /I&gt;_2</m> = <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0002"/>.
</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;-1.33333,0.666667,0.333333\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;0.333333,-1.66667,4.66667\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
